    "body": "> Reconsider the `interactivity` property\n> \n> [w3c/csswg-drafts#10711 (comment)](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10711#issuecomment-2777119047)\n\nNot sure it will make a huge difference, but just noting that a11y is a big part of the concerns here and tomorrow is [Global Accessibility Awareness Day](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_Accessibility_Awareness_Day) so even anyone who could potentially come to participate normally, probably can't tomorrow.  Others have mentioned that quite a lot of feedback has been given on the linked issue and elsewhere.",
